      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 1rem;">
        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
          <h3 style="margin: 0 0 0.5rem; font-size: 1rem;">❌ Forgetting the 30-Minute Fraction</h3>
          <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.93rem;">NDT is 2.5 hours ahead of EST, not 2 or 3 hours. Forgetting the 30-minute fraction causes scheduling errors.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background: var(--panel); border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 10px; padding: 1.25rem;">
